                                "type": 4,
                                "level": 1,
                                "elements": "Yutovo is a multifunctional calculator with a familiar visual display and editing of mathematical operations, combined with a text editor. It allows you to perform various calculations, combining calculations and text in a single document. After registering, you can save your documents to the cloud and share your calculations with others.",
